scenario re-baseline button during a visit: YIELD clears at once, budget untouched
selector clear
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
hand 1
wait 3
torch 5
within 1.0 state == YIELD
remember budget
press rebase                   # I8 checks the FSM's next step
within 0.1 state == LIT        # TP15: the button clears YIELD in well under 3 s
expect budget == @budget
expect event_fmm == 0          # the button declared that light part of the room: not charged
wait 3
expect state == LIT            # the torch is now part of the learned room
expect events == 1
